只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DSH-Desktop","id":"gh:1333356578","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"DSH-Desktop","slug":"JustGenius-s/DSH-Desktop","topics":["dsh","dsh-desktop","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"English ｜ 简体中文"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"DSH-Desktop"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Electron desktop shell for DeepSeek Harness (DSH). Uses Electron's embedded Node and bundled pnpm to"},{"id":"p3s2","text":" install `@deepseek-ai/dsh` into `~/.dsh/runtime` and serve the `dsh web` UI."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"## Download & Install"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Prebuilt packages are published on GitHub Releases. First launch installs the DSH runtime (~1-2 min)"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"rebuilt packages are published on GitHub Releases. First launch installs the DSH runtime (~1-2 min)."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"### macOS"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Requires macOS 13 (Ventura) or later."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"1. Download `DSH-Desktop-*.dmg` from the latest release.\n2. Open the `.dmg` and drag `DSH-Desktop.ap"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"p` into `/Applications`.\n3. The app is unsigned, so Gatekeeper blocks the first launch. Right-click "},{"id":"p8s3","text":"the app → **Open** and confirm, or run:"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"### Windows"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Requires 64-bit Windows."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"1. Download `DSH-Desktop Setup *.exe` (installer) or `DSH-Desktop-*-win.zip` (portable) from the lat"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"est release.\n2. Run the installer, or unzip the archive and launch `DSH-Desktop.exe`.\n3. The build i"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"s unsigned, so SmartScreen may warn. Click **More info** → **Run anyway**."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"DSH is installed from npm at runtime, not shipped with the app. Upgrading DSH = detect a newer versi"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"on on launch → click \"Update\" → optionally restart the web service (the desktop app stays open). No "},{"id":"p15s3","text":"rebuild or re-signing."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"After a successful boot, the web port is saved in `web-port.json` under Electron's user-data directo"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"ry. Cold starts reuse it when available so origin-scoped browser preferences survive restarts. If an"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"other process occupies that port, a new loopback port is allocated; the app never attaches to that p"},{"id":"p16s4","text":"rocess. Plugins must still persist durable data on the host to survive a port change. Development an"},{"id":"p16s5","text":"d installed apps keep separate port records."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Develop"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Use Node 24 LTS for the local build and test commands below. The test runner uses\nrecursive globs, a"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"nd the macOS launcher test needs `--no-use-system-ca` support."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Dev and packaged builds both use the current Electron executable and the external `~/.dsh/runtime`. "},{"id":"p20s2","text":"No standalone Node binary is downloaded or shipped. Plugin commands find a small `node` launcher thr"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"ough PATH; the executable path is supplied at each launch, so moving or upgrading the app does not l"},{"id":"p20s4","text":"ecutable path is supplied at each launch, so moving or upgrading the app does not leave stale paths."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Tests (no Electron window or browser required):"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"The TypeScript suites mirror source modules; the CommonJS suites exercise built output:"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"| Path                             | Runner      | What it may import                          |"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"| `test/unit/**/*.test.ts`         | vitest      | `src/` directly; Electron via `vi.mock`     |\n| `"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"test/integration/**/*.test.ts`  | vitest      | `src/` directly, multi-module flows         |\n| `tes"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"t/integration/**/*.test.cjs` | `node:test` | only built `dist/` and `scripts/`           |\n| `test/*"},{"id":"p25s4","text":".test.cjs`                | `node:test` | built desktop modules with Electron doubles |"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"The `.ts` suites run under vitest; the `.cjs` suites are plain `node:test`\n(see `vitest.config.ts`, "},{"id":"p26s2","text":"which deliberately excludes them). The `test` script\nbuilds fresh output first."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Package"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Packaging recollects pnpm and the launchers. Windows builds require the matching MSVC Native Tools e"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"nvironment and Windows SDK for the small forwarding `node.exe`."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"macOS artifacts use ad-hoc bundle signing by default and are not notarized.\nGatekeeper may block fir"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"st launch. Allow with:"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"For Developer ID signing and notarization, see the macOS signing guide."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"## Runtime dependencies"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"- Node supplied by Electron; pnpm (latest) and command launchers collected by `scripts/collect-runti"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"me.mjs`\n- `@deepseek-ai/dsh` (npm latest), installed to `~/.dsh/runtime`"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"## Updating Electron"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"Run `pnpm add -D -E electron@<version>` and `pnpm check`, then launch and test the packaged app."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"Launchers and native plugin builds use the running Electron's path and version. Keep the `runAsNode`"},{"id":"p37s2","text":" fuse enabled. DSH may reject a new Node/V8 combination, and existing ABI-specific plugins may need "},{"id":"p37s3","text":"rebuilding; verify the UI, terminals and plugin installation before release. The DSH installation is"},{"id":"p37s4","text":" shared with the CLI, so do not rebuild the entire shared runtime for Electron."},{"id":"p38s1","text":"## Desktop plugin API"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"The shell injects `window.dshDesktop` into the DSH page (`updates` / `seats` / `notify` / `overlays`"},{"id":"p39s2","text":" / `plugins`). Plugins should depend on that contract, not on Electron packaging code. See docs/desk"},{"id":"p39s3","text":"`). Plugins should depend on that contract, not on Electron packaging code. See docs/desktop-api.md."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"## Our plugins"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"Companion DSH plugins live in DSH-Plugs."},{"id":"p42s1","text":"## Thanks to"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"- Linux do"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
